{"3988560": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Astro Loopers", "steam_appid": 3988560, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Astro Loopers</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>What if you could rewind time — and team up with your past self?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br>Astro Loopers is a Sokoban-style puzzle game set in a cosmic universe, where every move echoes through time. Your past characters repeat their actions as time loops stack up — coordinate them to solve increasingly mind-bending stages.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3988560/extras/0e4a96422e8e13a13138f1ab9631c3c8.poster.avif?t=1787539789\" width=1170 height=500 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3988560/extras/0e4a96422e8e13a13138f1ab9631c3c8.webm?t=1787539789\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3988560/extras/0e4a96422e8e13a13138f1ab9631c3c8.mp4?t=1787539789\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Unique Characters</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each character comes with a special ability that interacts with blocks in different ways — <br>break them, push them, or pull them! <br>Master each character’s skill to solve complex puzzles and conquer every stage.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3988560/extras/596bcbb5a714e8d790443466878c549c.poster.avif?t=1787539789\" width=1170 height=500 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3988560/extras/596bcbb5a714e8d790443466878c549c.webm?t=1787539789\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3988560/extras/596bcbb5a714e8d790443466878c549c.mp4?t=1787539789\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Variety of Gimmicks</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stages are filled with diverse and tricky mechanics: <br>slippery ice floors, explosive blocks, and more! <br>Learning how to use each gimmick to your advantage is the key to mastering the puzzles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3988560/extras/80a66a54eff36e681e85fa53a10706fe.poster.avif?t=1787539789\" width=1170 height=500 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3988560/extras/80a66a54eff36e681e85fa53a10706fe.webm?t=1787539789\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3988560/extras/80a66a54eff36e681e85fa53a10706fe.mp4?t=1787539789\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Over 120 Stages</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Embark on an adventure across more than 120 stages in search of the Core Fragments scattered throughout space.  <br>From simple early puzzles to mind-bending challenges that will test your logic and creativity — your journey through time awaits!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Streaming &amp; Monetization Guidelines</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are free to stream, record, and monetize gameplay videos of <i>Astro Loopers</i>. <br>We encourage all creators to share and enjoy the game in any way they like!</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Astro Loopers</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>What if you could rewind time — and team up with your past self?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br>Astro Loopers is a Sokoban-style puzzle game set in a cosmic universe, where every move echoes through time. Your past characters repeat their actions as time loops stack up — coordinate them to solve increasingly mind-bending stages.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3988560/extras/0e4a96422e8e13a13138f1ab9631c3c8.poster.avif?t=1787539789\" width=1170 height=500 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3988560/extras/0e4a96422e8e13a13138f1ab9631c3c8.webm?t=1787539789\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3988560/extras/0e4a96422e8e13a13138f1ab9631c3c8.mp4?t=1787539789\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Unique Characters</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each character comes with a special ability that interacts with blocks in different ways — <br>break them, push them, or pull them! <br>Master each character’s skill to solve complex puzzles and conquer every stage.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3988560/extras/596bcbb5a714e8d790443466878c549c.poster.avif?t=1787539789\" width=1170 height=500 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3988560/extras/596bcbb5a714e8d790443466878c549c.webm?t=1787539789\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3988560/extras/596bcbb5a714e8d790443466878c549c.mp4?t=1787539789\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Variety of Gimmicks</strong></h2><p cl